  "title": "Don’t Let Past Investments Trap You into Bad Decisions",
  "description": "Don’t let past investments trap you into bad decisions. Here’s how: - Pause and evaluate: Ask, “If I hadn’t already invested, would I still continue?” - Set a clear stopping point: Define in advance when it’s time to quit. - Focus on future gains: Think about what you stand to gain moving forward, not what you’ve lost. Example: If you’ve spent weeks on a failing project, don’t keep going just to “make it worth it.”",
